// nova_pure_tools.nova — Pure NovaLang replacements for Python bridges
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Every function here replaces a legacy shell() call.
// NO PYTHON. NO py_call. Pure NovaLang only.
// Uses only NovaLang builtins + shell() for system commands (curl, powershell).
